      "id": "read_before_paid_slot_reallocation",
      "rule": "At E maximum, do not submit disabled elevate. First establish target membership, target ordinary status, authority/realm/holder-faith conditions and budget for the complete candidate chain. Treat demotion as a paid decision with utility loss, not a rollback."
    },
    {
      "id": "requery_after_each_business_change",
      "rule": "After confirmed independent demotion poststate, invalidate old snapshot/detail context, refresh target detail and exact normal permission/bypass/cost/cooldown before separately submitting elevate once."
    },
