      "id": "cooldown_key_is_part_of_action_identity",
      "rule": "Read demote_holy_site_decision and elevate_holy_site_decision separately. An active demotion cooldown did not block the observed first elevation; this does not prove a second demotion is legal or transferable to other actors/versions."
